#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_asset_protocol_oca.field_account_asset__l10n_sk_commissioning_protocol_date
msgid ""
"Date the commissioning protocol was made out (dátum vyhotovenia účtovného "
"dokladu, § 10 ods. 1 písm. d) zákona 431/2002). Empty: the protocol shows "
"the day it is printed."
